   256	    - Convert each real marker color into the same fixed glyph mapping as the base task: 2->yellow frame, 3->blue ring, 5->magenta diagonal blocks, 8->orange X.
   257	    - Use the marker as the glyph's top-left anchor; whenever glyph pixels run past the bottom or right edge, continue them from the opposite side of the grid instead of clipping them away.
   258	    - Remove any legend glyph from the output and skip the legend's label marker rather than expanding it.
